; A total cost becomes a per-unit cost first, so the residual is units times
; the rounded per-unit cost, not the stated total: asserting exactly -10 USD
; fails.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-04 * "total cost"
  Assets:Stock  3 STK {{10 USD}}
  Assets:Cash
2020-01-05 balance Assets:Cash  -10 USD
